#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In this first lesson of the course, we'll formulate a simple algorithmic "
"framework — known as the *query model* — and explore the advantages that "
"quantum computers offer within this framework.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sa unang leksyon ng kursong ito, bubuo tayo ng isang simpleng algorithmic "
"framework — kilala bilang ang *query model* — at titingnan natin ang mga "
"kalamangan na inaalok ng mga quantum computer sa loob ng framework na ito.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The query model of computation is like a petri dish for quantum algorithmic ideas.\n"
"It's rigid and unnatural in the sense that it doesn't accurately represent the sorts of computational problems we generally care about in practice, but it has nevertheless proved to be incredibly useful as a tool for developing quantum algorithmic techniques.\n"
"This includes the ones that power the most well-known quantum algorithms, such as Shor's algorithm for integer factorization.\n"
"The query model also happens to be a very useful framework for *explaining* quantum algorithmic techniques.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang query model ng computation ay parang isang petri dish para sa mga quantum algorithmic na ideya.\n"
"Ito ay matigas at hindi natural sa diwang hindi nito tumpak na kinakatawan ang mga uri ng computational na problema na karaniwang pinapahalagahan natin sa praktis, ngunit napatunayan pa rin itong napaka-kapaki-pakinabang bilang isang kasangkapan para sa pagbuo ng mga quantum algorithmic na teknik.\n"
"Kabilang dito ang mga nagpapalakas sa pinakasikat na mga quantum algorithm, tulad ng algorithm ni Shor para sa integer factorization.\n"
"Ang query model ay nagkataong isang napaka-kapaki-pakinabang na framework din para sa *pagpapaliwanag* ng mga quantum algorithmic na teknik.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After introducing the query model itself, we'll discuss the very first quantum algorithm that was discovered, which is *Deutsch's algorithm,* along with an extension of Deutsch's algorithm known as the *Deutsch-Jozsa algorithm*.\n"
"These algorithms demonstrate quantifiable advantages of quantum over classical computers within the context of the query model.\n"
"We'll then discuss a quantum algorithm known as *Simon's algorithm,* which offers a more robust and satisfying advantage of quantum over classical computations, for reasons that will be explained when we get to it.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pagkatapos ipakilala ang query model mismo, tatalakayin natin ang pinakaunang quantum algorithm na natuklasan, na siyang *Deutsch's algorithm,* kasama ang isang extension ng Deutsch's algorithm na kilala bilang ang *Deutsch-Jozsa algorithm*.\n"
"Ipinapakita ng mga algorithm na ito ang mga nasusukat na kalamangan ng quantum kumpara sa mga klasikal na computer sa konteksto ng query model.\n"
"Tatalakayin din natin ang isang quantum algorithm na kilala bilang *Simon's algorithm,* na nag-aalok ng mas matibay at mas kasiya-siyang kalamangan ng quantum kumpara sa mga klasikal na computation, sa mga dahilang ipapaliwanag natin kapag nakarating na tayo doon.\n"

